This product is a port of the Material Theme for Visual Studio Code to the
Zed editor. Colour palettes, accent presets and the derivation of UI and
syntax colours are taken from the Material Theme source, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:

  Material Theme — originally created by Mattia Astorino and contributors
  Source used: https://github.com/t3dotgg/vsc-material-but-i-wont-sue-you
               (fork that preserves the original Apache-2.0 license)
  Original license reference:
               https://github.com/Dramaga11/vsc-material-theme/blob/main/LICENSE

Modifications: palettes were extracted unchanged into palettes/material.json
and translated to Zed's theme schema and tree-sitter highlight captures by
scripts/build.py. Values Zed requires but Material does not define are derived
from the same palettes and marked "zed-adapt" in the build script.

